WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.865
Kip stood up.

2
00:00:04.866 --> 00:00:10.914
Snow blew all around him.

3
00:00:10.915 --> 00:00:14.250
"See you later, Bird!" Kip called.

4
00:00:14.251 --> 00:00:17.378
"I'm going to play in the—whoa!"

5
00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:21.331
A strong gust of wind blew.

6
00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:23.694
Kip flew through the air.

7
00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:26.072
He tumbled over and over.

8
00:00:26.073 --> 00:00:29.625
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

9
00:00:29.626 --> 00:00:35.754
Poomf! He landed in a big snowdrift.

10
00:00:35.755 --> 00:00:39.612
Kip pulled himself out of the snow.

11
00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:42.837
Wind blew toward Kip.

12
00:00:42.838 --> 00:00:49.004
Snow swirled around him.

13
00:00:49.005 --> 00:00:52.982
But Kip wanted to play anyway.

14
00:00:52.983 --> 00:01:01.454
"I'll build a snowman," said Kip.

15
00:01:01.455 --> 00:01:05.207
He rolled snow into a ball.

16
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:08.428
Soon he had a huge snowball.

17
00:01:08.429 --> 00:01:11.194
More snow was falling.

18
00:01:11.195 --> 00:01:17.304
Soon snow covered Kip.

19
00:01:17.305 --> 00:01:19.408
Then more wind blew.

20
00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:21.965
The snowball rolled over Kip.

21
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.528
"Ahh!" he cried.

22
00:01:24.529 --> 00:01:29.533
Kip was stuck to the huge snowball.

23
00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:32.396
The snowball rolled down a hill.

24
00:01:32.397 --> 00:01:36.570
It rolled straight toward the frozen pond.

25
00:01:36.571 --> 00:01:40.310
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

